// Title: Remote Access Tool - Team Viewer Session Started On MacOS Host
// Rule ID: f459ccb4-9805-41ea-b5b2-55e279e2424a
// Severity: low
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.t1133
// Category: process_creation
// Product: macos
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/macos/process_creation/proc_creation_macos_remote_access_tools_teamviewer_incoming_connection.yml
